Z||000003||Oreif||06-21-2001||01:00 AM||||For Part # 1,<BR>DUMP HER! Sorry I have a hard time with people (male or female) that do what she's doing. It's like she is seeing others for fun and jerking you along for the security, rides, etc. I've been thru it (Many many moons ago) and in the end the only one that ends up hurt is you.<P>Part # 2 <P>Take her out to a nice dinner and talk. See where it goes. No need to start a serious relationship. Just start as friends, If both of you get along and end up "perfect for each other" why not? <P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Songman||06-21-2001||01:05 AM||||I had about the same thing happen about...mmmm... about 20 years ago...<P>No offense to the ladies here because it probably goes both ways... but when you are a nice guy and think you are in love with a woman and she starts acting crazy right from the start, break it off because if you take them back over and over they will know that they can do it to you... <P>Nine years later and countless episodes of her cheating and lying, AND telling all of our family and friends that it was ME doing it... two engagements, and I can't even tell you how many cars I bought her and everything else... totally spoiled her...<P>I realized my mistake after about 5 years but I was already in too deep. She took all of my self-confidence away from me and made me feel just like you do now.. whenever I caught her doing something, she got mad at me for catching her. And then she made me think I was lucky that she came back to me...<P>When I finally realized I wasn't going to take it anymore it was still hard on me. After it all, I still loved her. I sat at home for a year before I finally started going out again..<P>Don't do what I did.. If a girl cheats on you within the first year or so, cut her loose. I MIGHT understand if there was a failing 6-7 years in and things had just gotten boring, but probably not even then... Save yourself the heartache and cut this girl loose..<P>And about the other girl.. Let me tell you, looks fade, brother... Go for the one that you can talk to and share with...<P>Good luck to you..<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Pontiaddict||06-21-2001||01:25 AM||||#1: Like everyone else said, "Kick her down the road and don't look back!"<P>#2: This one is tricky because it's a rebound thing. Try to meet her a few more times in a non datelike situation. Then if you think you're ready then I guess you should go for it.||||reg||1
Z||000006||AkursedX||06-21-2001||02:09 AM||||Ok, I'll keep this short.<P>Go out with the new girl!  When you break up with someone, you break up with them for a reason.  In the words of Montel "An Ex is an Ex for a reason!!"<P>On a side note.  Trust NO ONE!!  That's the easy part.  The hard part is fooling the other people into thinking that you do actually trust them.  You'll save yourself from getting burnt.<P>Speaking of burnt, I wonder if I'll get flamed for this.  So as a disclaimer, I will say that this is just my opinion, and if someone else doesn't like it, I don't care.  You have a right to have your own opinion, and I will respect it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Good luck with your situation <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Ken Wittlief||06-21-2001||07:43 AM||||Fromula<P>youre a guy, right? (Im assuming here)<P>maybe this sounds funny, you sound like the kinda girl that guys have been trying to figure out here for the  last month.<P>  You know the girls we are talking about: they look really hot, and they only go out with guys that treat them like dirt, and slap them around, and they run back for more because:<P> "Because I LOVE him, and i KNOW he LOVES ME!"<P>  "Besides, hes SOOOOO CUTE!"<P>  Im not trying to make light of your situation, but you sound like the male counterpart of this.<P>  If babe #2 looked better than babe #1, would you even be asking use what to do? Is there some reason you think you are not good enough for good-hearted babe #2, so you have to put up with all this Kwrap from babe #1? Everyone seems to think you are a great guy... do you think they are wrong?<P>   there are something like 6 billion people in the world now, half are women. Until you stand at the alter and say, "I do!" you are free to keep looking.<P>  Embrace that and thank god you dont live in a country where someone else picks your mate for you. You are free to choose. Dont ever feel like you are stuck in a relationship - right up to the point where you say "I do" you can still change your mind and flee back down the isle alone.||||reg||1
