Z||000011||Ken Wittlief||06-21-2001||09:57 AM||||Jealosy is a normal primal instinctive emotion - just like the other ones that make you put yourself in danger to protect your children, or to fight off an attack on your person. Its there to make sure you beat to death any slimeball that is trying to steal your mate, or to set the alarms off if you mate is starting to stray.<P>  If GF is putting you in a postion that SHOULD make you jealous (esp having guys spend the night!?!? WTF is right!) if she is pushing your buttons - then you should be jealous. Dont feel guilty for being normal.<P>  "Dont you trust me?" is the cheaters anthem. A thoughtful mate doesnt put you in a postion where you feel insecure.||||reg||1
