Z||000037||fierofrek||06-23-2001||04:23 AM||||Ok, the general feeling is lose #1, and go for #2. I however agree with what Ken last said. I once heard a saying "who watches the watchers?" ok, change a few words and "who saves the saviour?" while you are out saving people (while this is noble, taken to far it can be destructive)what's happening to you and your life? Don't get me wrong, help people, but don't let it run your life. Giving everything for someone you love is great, but everyone I know that's done that had love in return Before giving.<BR>kind of sounds to me like a "father-figure" thing, good in and of itself, bad when taken as a role for life.<P>just my humble opinion. hope it works out for you!<p>[This message has been edited by fierofrek (edited 06-23-2001).]||||reg||3
